wt(R/'validation-report.md','''# Validation Report\n\nGenerated deterministically with seed **20260921**. Validator requires ten lookups, exactly **10,000 rows per lookup / 100,000 total records**, all three incident stages, all four benign look-alikes, cross-host service activity, responder actions, and explicit evidence gaps.''')
